Execution:- If you want to get the output in text format
 mongosh  mongodb://00.000.00.00:27017  --eval "var _printJSON=false;" getMongoData.js > /tmp/getMongoData-output.log

   If you want to get the out put in json format
ongosh  mongodb://00.000.00.00:27017 --quiet --norc getMongoData.js > /tmp/getMongoData-output.json
 
